<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Services I used were Amazon Bedrock for calling foundation models, FastAPI for building API endpoints, and dotenv for managing environment variables. Key concepts I learnt include the difference between MODEL_ID and MODEL_ARN, how to extend an API with new endpoints, handling environment variables, and the contrast between direct model invocation and Knowledge Base queries.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7 8]
>>
endobj
235 0 obj
<<
